<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VideoServer downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Adams Harkness analyst Jonathan Stone said he lowered his rating on VideoServer Inc stock to market performer from attractive.</p>
<p>-- He cited expectations of declining sales by VideoServer to PictureTel Corp. VideoServer produces network equipment and related software used for multimedia conferences.</p>
<p>-- Stone cut his 1997 earnings estimate on VideoServer to $0.90 a share from $0.95.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 6 at 29-1/4 early Thursday afternoon.</p>
</text>
